@startuml M4-用例图
' ============================================================
' 高校智慧教务选课平台 —— M4 选课与候补 用例图
' 大作业2 交付物；负责人：苏俊毅 04241618
' 渲染：plantuml 01-用例图.puml  （需 GraphViz，或保留下面的 smetana 布局）
' ============================================================
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #2F5597
  ArrowColor #2F5597
}

actor "学生" as Student
actor "教务管理员" as Admin

rectangle "选课与候补子系统" {

  usecase "查询可选课程"        as UC01
  usecase "查看课程详情"        as UC02
  usecase "选课"                as UC03
  usecase "校验选课条件"        as UC04
  usecase "退课"                as UC05
  usecase "加入候补"            as UC06
  usecase "查看候补位次"        as UC07
  usecase "取消候补"            as UC08
  usecase "查看我的课程"        as UC09
  usecase "自动递补候补队列"    as UC10
  usecase "发送候补成功通知"    as UC11

  usecase "维护选课批次"        as UC20
  usecase "开启/提前关闭选课"   as UC21
  usecase "维护批次开放教学班"  as UC22
  usecase "手动触发候补递补"    as UC23
  usecase "查看选课进度统计"    as UC24
}

Student --> UC01
Student --> UC02
Student --> UC03
Student --> UC05
Student --> UC06
Student --> UC07
Student --> UC08
Student --> UC09

Admin --> UC20
Admin --> UC21
Admin --> UC22
Admin --> UC23
Admin --> UC24

' ---- include / extend 关系 ----
UC03 ..> UC04 : <<include>>
UC06 ..> UC04 : <<include>>
UC05 ..> UC10 : <<include>>
UC10 ..> UC04 : <<include>>
UC10 ..> UC11 : <<include>>

UC06 .> UC03 : <<extend>>\n【容量已满】

note right of UC04
  **校验选课条件（共 13 步，见活动图）**
  1 是否为学生 → 2 教学班存在 → 3 属于当前学期
  4 存在有效批次 → 5 属于当前批次 → 6 状态允许选课
  7 专业符合 → 8 年级符合 → 9 是否已选
  10 时间冲突 → 11 学分上限 → 12 容量 → 13 写入/恢复记录
end note
@enduml
